{"story":true,"name":"The Eldergate Network","kit":"","tile":4,"autorun":[{"unless":"eg_enter","cine":true,"actions":[{"type":"cine","on":true},{"type":"music","url":"/assets/Music/mp3/22. Ancient Library.mp3"},{"type":"fade","to":"clear","t":2.5,"wait":false},{"type":"cam","x":0,"z":24,"yaw":0,"pitch":36,"dist":16,"t":0},{"type":"say","who":"","text":"The stair is longer than any ruin should hold. The mark on Kenji's hand throbs in time with your steps. At the bottom, lamp after lamp wakes along a hall of pale stone."},{"type":"cam","x":0,"z":6,"yaw":0,"pitch":26,"dist":22,"t":5,"wait":false},{"type":"say","who":"Lyra","text":"That script. Not Veyran, not anything I have seen on a map of the Mind's. It is older. I can read it, barely. It says: ELDERGATE."},{"type":"say","who":"Kenji","text":"Brannoch called the keep Dawnwatch."},{"type":"say","who":"Lyra","text":"Dawnwatch is what soldiers call a hill they were told to hold. Eldergate is the name this place was born with."},{"type":"say","who":"Miya","text":"Then somebody built a city on top of whatever is down here, and forgot it."},{"type":"say","who":"Lyra","text":"Or tried to. Read the walls. Every plate is a page. Let's find out who builds a door this big."},{"type":"flag","key":"eg_enter"},{"type":"follow","t":1.2}]}],"objectives":[{"unless":"eg_t4","text":"Read the Chronicle plates in the hall (four along the walls, a fifth in the east alcove)."},{"unless":"eg_ledger","text":"Look into the Watcher's Ledger in the west alcove of the great hall."},{"unless":"eg_t5","text":"Read the Last King's plate in the east alcove."},{"unless":"eg_core","text":"Touch the Core in the centre of the great hall."},{"unless":"eg_veyra_go","text":"The Veyra gate is open, third from the east along the north wall. Step through when ready."},{"text":"Eldergate's other gates are silent. Return when Veyra has changed."}],"music":{"url":"/assets/Music/mp3/22. Ancient Library.mp3"},"pieces":[["/assets/3D/Megastructure/SM_floor_module_0